      "message": "docs(mcp): camcraft-mcp skill lists the drawn-cutter tools\n\nAdds get_tool_cutter_profile and set_tool_cutter_profile to the skill's\ntool table, matching their definitions in crates/app/src/mcp/cutter_tools.rs\non main. set_tool_cutter_params and the neck-feeds-the-checks note are\nleft for after #1012 / #957 merge.\n\nBumps .claude/PROCESS_VERSION 16 -> 17 (skill is a process file).\n\nRefs #1013\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
